          </?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH69>
        ]>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task #P1-T1 { name = "建立 run 与 Material source acceptance fixtures" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6A>
            覆盖 Type/Instance、输入事实、独立确认、冻结 revision、resolve/reject、immutable Material、receipt replay 与 fresh-runtime recovery。
            </?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6A>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P1-T1-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6B>
              RED tests 明确拒绝未经确认的执行与不稳定 latest resolution
              </?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6B>
              <Criterion #P1-T1-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6C>
              fixture 记录 source operation 到 target component/tool/CLI operation 的映射
              </?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6C>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P2 { name = "Type、Instance 与冻结运行 facts" status = "DONE" order = 1 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6D>
        建立 definition revision、可重复实例化、输入事实和 confirmed start；禁止 start 后修改输入。
        </?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6D>
        <Gate [
          <Criterion ?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6E>
