              </?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6J>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task #P2-T2 { name = "实现独立确认与冻结 start" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6K>
            start 未确认仅返回预览；确认后冻结 definition、input 与 bindings，创建 descriptor/receipt 并执行 depa-flows runtime。
            </?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6K>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P2-T2-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6M>
