              </?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6N>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P3 { name = "Immutable Material 生命周期与 receipts" status = "DONE" order = 2 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6P>
        建立 import/inspect/bind/export/replay/cleanup，所有运行输入输出都指向精确 immutable revision。
