              </?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6V>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task #P3-T2 { name = "实现 run receipts、replay 与 lease cleanup" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6W>
            start 冻结 input bindings，完成时登记 output refs；replay 建新 run 并继承精确 refs；cleanup 仅清理已确认且无 lease 的 revisions。
            </?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6W>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P3-T2-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M05F1PR0VG54CV01QKW6BH6X>
